config SPRD_7SRESET
	tristate "Spreadtrum PMIC 7s reset controller"
	depends on MFD_SC27XX_PMIC || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Exposes the PMIC long-press (7s) reset knobs as sysfs attributes
	  of the hw-reset child device:

	      module_disable, hard_mode, short_mode, keypad_mode,
	      threshold_time

	  Each attribute reads/writes the PMIC register given by the
	  second cell of the "reg" property (index 1); keypad_mode uses
	  the first cell on every PMIC except SC2731.  UMP9620 additionally
	  locks/unlocks the register through 0x23d8 (bit 15 = status).

	  Port of the vendor 5.4 `sprd_7sreset.ko`.
